(corpus-ch4-089)
*optimize a for vel=max on segment 1, trajectory 1
  constrain alt on segment 6, trajectory 1
    = alt on segment 4, trajectory 3
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when time>1 stop
*end
